f-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids shows September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2026, the middle of the grids got 74% of normal in May to June and 66% in June to July. All 8 grids had their driest year in 1976, with grid 32533 at 52% of normal that year.</p>"}
